<section class="sec" id="faq" style="background:#fff">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">FAQ</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">The questions people actually <span class="serif">ask.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">If yours isn't here, a counsellor answers it on a 20-minute call.</p>
<div class="faq-wrap">
<div class="acc reveal">
<details open=""><summary>I already use Excel daily. Will this still teach me anything? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Almost certainly. Most daily users have never touched Power Query, XLOOKUP, proper pivots or macros, the exact skills that separate an executive from an analyst. The first session audit shows you the gap.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is two months really enough to get a job? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">For MIS and reporting roles, yes. These roles hire on demonstrated skill: interviews are practical tests, and you will have drilled exactly those tests plus a dashboard portfolio.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you teach VBA and automation? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Automation basics, yes: macros, intro VBA and AI-assisted formulas, enough to automate your own reports. Deep VBA development is beyond this course by design.</div></details>
<details><summary>What salary can I expect after this course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">MIS executives typically start between Rs 2 and 3.5 lakh, moving to Rs 3.5 to 5.5 within a couple of years. Many graduates continue into Data Analytics for the bigger jump.</div></details>
<details><summary>Can this course lead into data analytics later? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">That is the designed path. Excel graduates receive fee credit toward our Data Analytics course, and everything here, pivots, Power Query, dashboards, transfers directly.</div></details>
<details><summary>Will AI tools like Copilot make Excel skills pointless? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">The opposite: Copilot makes skilled users faster and confuses unskilled ones. We teach AI-assisted Excel as part of the course, so you direct the tool instead of guessing with it.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is it online or classroom, and is Malayalam support available? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Both. In-person batches in Trivandrum, Kochi and Bengaluru, plus live online batches across Kerala and the GCC. Sessions are in clear English with Malayalam support.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you guarantee a job after the course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">No, and we will not pretend otherwise. We provide structured placement support and real introductions across 400+ partners, with support continuing six months after you finish.</div></details>
</div>
<aside class="faq-aside reveal">
<div class="aside-card">
<span class="av-lg photo">[ Anjali · photo ]</span>
<span class="k">Most chosen first step</span>
